### 3. Repository Layer
#### [NEW] [repository/reservation.go](file:///c:/Go/shopMe/internal/handler/repository/reservation.go)
- `CreateWithTx(ctx, tx, res)`: Insert reservation and increment `reserved_quantity` in `inventory` table.
- `FindByUserID(ctx, userID, filter)`: Get customer's reservations with auto-expiry check.
- `FindByShopID(ctx, shopID, filter)`: Get shop's incoming reservations.
- `FindByID(ctx, id)`: Retrieve single reservation.
- `VerifyAndCompleteWithTx(ctx, tx, shopID, code)`: Validate code, mark status `completed`, deduct stock `quantity -= reserved_qty`, `reserved_quantity -= reserved_qty`.
- `CancelWithTx(ctx, tx, id, isShopOwner)`: Release `reserved_quantity`, mark `cancelled`.

